## Final acceptance

☐ A consumer project selects `msbuild`, `gcc`, or `eslint` with
  `settings.error_format`.
☐ Live `problem.recorded` events render in the selected standard format.
☐ Matchable diagnostics contain a trustworthy source, line, column, severity,
  and message.
☐ Location-less problems remain visible without fabricated coordinates.
☐ Full structured messages and traces remain available in results, history,
  and logs.
☐ Non-problem progress, transport, scheduling, cleanup, persistence, and exit
  behavior remain unchanged.
☐ DwarfSpec tests cover DwarfSpec behavior only; VS Code behavior remains
  outside the automated test contract.
